    id: 'll15-seasoned-with-salt',
    title: 'Seasoned with Salt (the science of conversation meets the Word)',
    // Harvested 2026-07-10: a conversation with Prof. Alison Wood Brooks
    // (Harvard behavioral scientist; "Talk: The Science of Conversation and
    // the Art of Being Ourselves") — anxiety reframed as excitement, the
    // conversational compass, the TALK framework (Topics · Asking · Listening
