      howToRun: 'Open in prayer + read the Scripture (3): read John 3:13, Genesis 28:12, and John 1:51 in sequence \u2014 let the room see the ladder become a Person. | The big idea (10): the seven claims from the 2.9-million-view conversation, each met by the Word \u2014 real realm, consistent entities, the lockout, all-is-mind, the receiver theory, beyond-morality, certainty-as-enemy. | Go deeper (10): walk Acts 19:13-16 (Sceva) against John 10:1-10 \u2014 two doors, two economies; then Athens (Acts 17:22-27) as the posture toward experiencers. | Reflect together (10): use the prompts; expect someone in the room to know someone who has used \u2014 keep the tone of Colossians 1:13, an open exit, not a courtroom. | Take it with you (2): each person writes their three-sentence 1 Peter 3:15 answer (the realm / the ladder / the hunger) and says it aloud once.',
