        'Where is the line between Hughes\u2019 comfort ("everyone hides this too") and Psalm 32\u2019s joy ("thou forgavest... shout for joy")? Which one have you actually experienced \u2014 and what would it take to cross from the first to the second this week (1 John 1:9; James 5:16)?',
